graph TD
    A[Extracellular Signal] --> B[G Protein-Coupled Receptor]
    B --> C[Receptor Activation]
    C --> D[Gα Subunit Exchange]
    D --> E[GDP Release]
    E --> F[GTP Binding]
    F --> G[Gα-GTP Complex]
    G --> H[Effector Protein Activation]
    H --> I[Second Messenger Production]
    I --> J[Signal Amplification]
    J --> K[Cellular Response]
    
    %% Termination
    K --> L[GTP Hydrolysis]
    L --> M[Gα-GDP Complex]
    M --> N[Gβγ Reassociation]
    N --> O[Signal Termination]
    
    %% Alternative pathways
    G --> P[Gβγ Signaling]
    P --> Q[Ion Channel Modulation]
    Q --> R[Direct Cellular Response]
    
    %% Key proteins
    S[GPCR] --> B
    T[Gα] --> D
    U[Gβγ] --> N
    V[GTP] --> F
    W[GDP] --> E
    X[Effector Proteins] --> H
    Y[Second Messengers] --> I
    
